<title>USA: TABLE-Omnicare Q2 net rises before charges.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Omnicare Q2 net rises before charges.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare Inc and Subsidiary Companies</p>
<p>Consolidated Summary of Operations (unaudited)(a) (000's except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended    Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				    June 30,		 June 30,</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Sales		  $ 203,060  $ 121,833 $ 384,668  $ 239,018</p>
<p> Net income	   15,138(a)     10,396  28,581(b)    18,525</p>
<p>Earnings per share (c):</p>
<p>   Primary		0.19(a)	 0.15   0.36(b)	 0.30</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	0.19(a)	 0.14   0.36(b)	 0.28</p>
<p>Average number of shares outstanding (c):</p>
<p>   Primary		 80,249     67,341    79,239     61,595</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	 80,440     77,825    79,335     72,462</p>
<p>Supplemental Pro Forma Data (unaudited):</p>
<p>Net income, as</p>
<p>  reported		 15,138     10,396    28,581     18,525</p>
<p>Acquisition expenses,</p>
<p>  net of taxes	   575(a)	    -  1,429(b)	    -</p>
<p> Pro forma net income  15,713     10,396    30,010     18,525</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per share (c):</p>
<p>   Primary		0.20(a)	 0.15   0.38(b)	 0.30</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	0.20(a)	 0.14   0.38(b)	 0.28</p>
<p>(a) Acquisition expenses related to a pooling-of-interests</p>
<p>transaction of $693,000 pretax, or $575,000 after taxes,</p>
<p>are included in the three-month period. Net income,</p>
<p>excluding this charge, for the three months ended June 30,</p>
<p>1997 was $15,713,000 ($0.20 per primary/fully diluted shr) (b) Acquisition expenses related to pooling-of-interests</p>
<p>transactions of $1,671,000 pretax, or $1,429,000 after</p>
<p>taxes, are included in the six-month period.  Net income,</p>
<p>excluding this charge, for the six-months ended June 30,</p>
<p>1997 was $30,010,000 ($0.38 per primary/fully diluted shr) (c) Adjusted for 2-for-1 stock split distributed June 27, 1996.</p>
